# Point decoding (RFC 8032 section 5.1.3, spec/crypto/ed25519.bend: decode):
# whatever it returns is a valid point of the curve. With
# u = y^2 - 1 and v = d y^2 + 1 the decoder accepts x only after checking
# v x^2 == u (or v x^2 == -u, then x sqrt(-1)), which is the curve equation.

